{"3212110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "On The Flip Side", "steam_appid": 3212110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skate into a world of nostalgia with <i><strong>On the Flip Side</strong></i>. A toy-sized skateboard game where the thrill of childhood playtime comes alive! Inspired by those memorable moments with your favourite toys and action figures, explore iconic locations around the house, from the bedroom and kitchen to the garage, backyard and attic, where everyday objects become larger-than-life playgrounds and unforgettable skate spots, as your imagination kicks into overdrive. Relive the magic and fun of being a kid, but this time on wheels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/554bfe2099f1642ca6a1a9d3a0420006.poster.avif?t=1787122169\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/554bfe2099f1642ca6a1a9d3a0420006.webm?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/554bfe2099f1642ca6a1a9d3a0420006.mp4?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your style with head-to-toe character customisation. Customise everything from skin tone, eye colour and shape to hairstyles, clothing and decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/00b72d2692f4036474ae8824723bb2b9.poster.avif?t=1787122169\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/00b72d2692f4036474ae8824723bb2b9.webm?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/00b72d2692f4036474ae8824723bb2b9.mp4?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hundreds of awesome rewards including gear and decks as you play, giving you even more ways to personalise your skater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/7c119d2de48e67f37e5044b86c76f069.poster.avif?t=1787122169\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/7c119d2de48e67f37e5044b86c76f069.webm?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/7c119d2de48e67f37e5044b86c76f069.mp4?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and share epic skate parks or carve through the creative parks built by other players.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skate into a world of nostalgia with <i><strong>On the Flip Side</strong></i>. A toy-sized skateboard game where the thrill of childhood playtime comes alive! Inspired by those memorable moments with your favourite toys and action figures, explore iconic locations around the house, from the bedroom and kitchen to the garage, backyard and attic, where everyday objects become larger-than-life playgrounds and unforgettable skate spots, as your imagination kicks into overdrive. Relive the magic and fun of being a kid, but this time on wheels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 