c119d2de48e67f37e5044b86c76f069.webm?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/extras/7c119d2de48e67f37e5044b86c76f069.mp4?t=1787122169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and share epic skate parks or carve through the creative parks built by other players.</p>", "short_description": "Skate into a world of nostalgia with On the Flip Side, a toy-sized skateboard game where everyday objects become larger-than-life playgrounds. Create custom skaters, unlock gear, build and share skate parks. Relive the magic of being a kid, but this time on wheels.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/68e7283bd437e47ba74c12fad810197c7a824afd/header.jpg?t=1787122169", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/b58ffd20cb811c106a1b7ce45db27b918efdf526/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787122169", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212110/b58ffd20cb811c106a1b7ce45db27b918efdf526/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787122169", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3-2100 | AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon R7 360<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows